- Integration tests need Docker running (testcontainers; local skip if unavailable, CI hard-fails).
- Error codes are stable kebab-case strings (spec §5.2); DB unique-violations map by **constraint name** (D7); PG error text is never surfaced (PII rule).
- Timestamps: always `clock.now()` (µs-truncated); repos receive `now` as a parameter — no clock in adapters.
- No file may have a Windows-reserved base name (CON, PRN, AUX, NUL, COM1–9, LPT1–9).
